# LIMPET: the full size: 26 decks and a secret one; 3 of the 26 are survival
# decks; 23 hide honey (with the Dreadnought's, 24); every deck has one pod,
# a bulb where it needs one and its honey's ! block; 29 pods in the hub;
# the screens' words fit; every sprite is the right size.
game limpet
wait 5
expect levels_ok == 0
expect decks_of_kind0 == 23
expect decks_of_kind1 == 3
expect decks_of_kind2 == 1
expect npods == 29
expect art_bad == 0
expect layout == 0
